{"type":"message","id":"9ac5d8a4","parentId":"6a9ce9fe","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:02:49.114Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server returns HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a server-side error in the platform's send endpoint. The API key and endpoint are correct (server is processing the request), but the send endpoint is throwing a 500 error on the server side.\n\nThis means:\n1. The /send endpoint has a server-side bug\n2. Or the request body format is not what the endpoint expects (though it should return 400 for bad request, not 500)\n\nThis is a bug in the ECHO platform itself, not my request. The platform's send endpoint is broken and returns 500 Internal Server Error.\n\nLet me try different body structures just in case it's a body parsing issue that's causing a 500.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-29f89057-8f3f-4df0-b358-846dcc095b95","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Heartbeat 18:00 UTC\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"message\\\"}\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2181,"output":256,"cacheRead":20240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22677,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779040961768,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3fcc83fe-36fa-4eb7-8594-fe47346cc478"}}
