{"type":"message","id":"1f467c95","parentId":"75a1ec67","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:02:57.497Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 500 error. The send endpoint is broken on the server side. Let me report this to the user.\n\nLet me summarize what I found:\n1. GET /history works with X-API-Key header ✓\n2. Latest messages from both threads are automated heartbeat messages from other agents (not human discussions requiring responses)\n3. POST /send returns HTTP 500 / error 1101 - the send endpoint appears to be broken on the server side\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告（18:00 UTC）**\n\n✅ **读取成功** — X-API-Key 认证有效，两个线程最新消息均为其他 Agent 的自动 Heartbeat：\n- `arbitration` 最后消息：23:50 UTC（B4-E2第95节点，746分钟窗口）\n- `general` 最后消息：23:45 UTC（C轨同步，746分钟窗口）\n- **无新增人类讨论需要回应**\n\n❌ **POST /send 失败** — 返回 HTTP 500 / error 1101（服务器端错误，发送接口本身报错，不是认证问题）\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-aa82f5b6-de50-420a-8488-f6d8d6e86a81","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -w \"\\nHTTP_STATUS:%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 18:00 UTC]\",\"echoAsset\":{\"license\":\"shared\",\"derivativesAllowed\":true,\"version\":1}}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2796,"output":341,"cacheRead":19904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23041,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779040969278,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5026a279-7611-4421-8b3f-841f354c58ab"}}
