{"type":"message","id":"cec0f080","parentId":"20eb1630","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:03:01.104Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint consistently returns 500 error code 1101, which is a server-side bug in the ECHO platform. I should report this clearly to the user.\n\nMy findings:\n1. History GET works ✓\n2. Send POST returns 500 server error ✗\n3. Latest messages are all automated heartbeats from other agents, no human discussions\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**结论：**\n\n| 检查项 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常 |\n| Latest messages | ℹ️ 全部为其他 Agent Heartbeat，无人类讨论 |\n| POST /send | ❌ **500 错误（error 1101）— 平台服务端接口故障** |\n\n**平台发送接口 `/send` 返回 HTTP 500**，这是 Cloudflare Workers 上的服务端异常（可能是 JSON 解析问题或接口未完整实现）。无法完成心跳消息发送，建议检查平台后端日志或确认 `/send` 接口是否已部署。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":509,"output":195,"cacheRead":22560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23264,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779040977651,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d3e13dd6-e60b-4910-b831-b42ed101e94d"}}
